# Data and Prisma

- Source of truth is PostgreSQL via Prisma. Do not add a second ORM.
- Required concepts: User, Workspace, Membership, Page, Comment, Snapshot.
- Membership roles: `view` | `comment` | `edit` (owner allowed if needed). Same enum in schema, API, and UI.
- Comments: author, page, timestamp, body, document anchor.
- Snapshots: author, timestamp, content or Yjs update reference; document encoding in `docs/`.
- Migrations for every schema change. Do not rewrite applied migrations.
- Index foreign keys and room-auth lookups (`userId`, `workspaceId`, `pageId`).
